{
  "message": "Your new devlog reports a title screen and logo, but still shows no playable build. Halfway through, only references have evidence, leaving the goal at risk, though this common gap is fixable here. Drop the trailer storyboard and use the remaining hours to publish one small level with a playable jump. We’ll meet after the next sprint; I look forward to an openable build and your playtest notes ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Build one small level with a playable jump, a reachable finish, and a restart. Publish a downloadable build or browser link with launch instructions.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask someone outside the team to open the build and attempt the level without coaching. Post their results and any blockers in a short devlog with the build link.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

